For the base models, we used a single model obtained by averaging the last 5 checkpoints, which were written at 10-minute intervals. For the big models, we averaged the last 20 checkpoints. We used beam search with a beam size of 4 and length penalty \\alpha=0.6 [38]. These hyperparameters were chosen after experimentation on the development set. We set the maximum output length during inference to input length + 50 , but terminate early when possible [38].', '8', '8', NULL, '2026-08-11 17:04:16.721031+00'),
  ('50', '1', '6.2 Model Variations', 'Base model 설정', '49', '| Parameter | 값 |
| --- | --- |
| N | 6 |
| dmodel | 512 |
| dff | 2048 |
| h | 8 |
| dk | 64 |
| dv | 64 |
| dropout | 0.1 |
