  ('143', '4', '3.3 Conditioning Mechanisms', 'CLIP Text Conditioning', '11', E'We use pretrained models such as CLIP text encoders to provide conditioning information.

Similar to other types of generative
models DBLP:journals/corr/MirzaO14; NIPS2015_8d55a249, diffusion models
are in principle capable of modeling conditional distributions of the form
