inputs y such as text Reed2016GenerativeAT, semantic maps  spade; DBLP:conf/cvpr/IsolaZZE17 or other image-to-image translation tasks Isola2017ImagetoImageTW.', '5', '5', NULL, '2026-08-11 17:04:18.122244+00'),
  ('144', '4', '3.1 Perceptual Image Compression', 'Time Embedding', '12', 'The diffusion timestep is provided to the network through sinusoidal positional embeddings.

Our perceptual compression model
is based on previous work DBLP:journals/corr/abs-2012-09841 and
