  ('280', '8', '3.1 Vision Transformer (ViT)', 'Position Embedding', '5', 'Position embeddings are added to the patch embeddings to retain positional information.

Position embeddings are added to the patch embeddings to retain positional information.
We use standard learnable 1D position embeddings, since we have not observed significant performance gains from using more advanced 2D-aware position embeddings (Appendix D.4).
The resulting sequence of embedding vectors serves as input to the encoder.', '3', '3', NULL, '2026-08-11 17:04:19.700599+00'),
  ('281', '8', '3.1 Vision Transformer (ViT)', 'Transformer Encoder Input', '6', 'The resulting sequence is fed to a standard Transformer encoder.

